sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Client
  participant G as Nginx / API Gateway
  participant A as Auth Service
  participant O as Orders Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant N as NATS
  participant T as Temporal
  participant S as Moto S3

  C->>G: POST /orders
  G->>A: validate caller
  A-->>G: authenticated identity
  G->>O: forward request and identity
  O->>DB: insert order and outbox event in one transaction
  DB-->>O: commit

  par HTTP response
    O-->>G: order response
    G-->>C: order response
  and NATS publication
    O->>DB: claim pending event
    O->>N: publish to ORDERS JetStream
    N-->>O: publish acknowledgement
    O->>DB: mark published after broker acknowledgement
  and Raw data export
    O->>DB: claim raw-export-pending event
    O->>S: write deterministic JSONL object
    O->>DB: record export result
  and Workflow dispatch
    O->>DB: claim workflow only after NATS publication
    O->>T: start deterministic workflow
    T-->>O: workflow start accepted
    O->>DB: mark workflow started
  end
